@startuml
skin rose
skinparam ActivityFontSize 15
skinparam ArrowFontSize 12
start
:User executes intro INDEX by/[INTRODUCER_INDEX];
:Look up the supporter, and the
introducer if one is given;

'Since the beta syntax does not support placing the condition outside the
'diamond we place it as the true branch instead.

if () then ([the introducer is the supporter,
or the supporter introduced the
introducer, directly or through
other supporters])
    :Show why the introduction
    cannot be recorded;
elseif () then ([the introducer
would not change])
    :Show that nothing
    was changed;
else ([else])
    :Record the new introducer,
    or remove the record if
    none is given;
endif
stop
@enduml
